{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modular_arithmetic\" title=\"Modular arithmetic\">remainder</a> of the division of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, then the remainder of the division of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/d/0ad069be59a1dd259d51051fa77f3b9a9dd3b8bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 2\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 3\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 4\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/3979fd0539b039a8414ab1e50e5ab2a7f7ebff3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle  a \\equiv 23 \\pmod{35}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/003f5bb4252809fff4a25a6cc2ffd34f9e79f4cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle 7 | 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a460d6909d7eb7031f3cccd63b0a71b300e04b64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle a \\equiv 23 \\equiv 2 \\pmod{7} \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"212\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\"